---
// V3 · Soft Portrait — warm portrait mood
// Cream-pink gradient + rose accent + elegant Cormorant serifs + large rounded cards
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>V3 · Soft · Rain Fan</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-1: #F8EDE3;
        --bg-2: #E8D5C4;
        --paper: #FFFFFF;
        --ink: #3D2C24;
        --muted: #8A6F60;
        --whisper: #B79C8A;
        --accent: #C97B7B;
        --accent-dark: #A55F5F;
        --border: rgba(61, 44, 36, 0.1);
      }

      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body {
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, var(--bg-1) 0%, transparent 50%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, var(--bg-2) 0%, transparent 50%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-1) 0%, var(--bg-2) 100%);
        background-attachment: fixed;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      /* Preview nav */
      .preview-nav {
        position: fixed; top: 1rem; right: 1rem; z-index: 50;
        background: var(--paper);
        border-radius: 9999px;
        padding: 0.375rem 0.5rem;
        display: flex; gap: 0.25rem; align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(61, 44, 36, 0.08);
      }
      .preview-nav a, .preview-nav span {
        color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem; border-radius: 9999px;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .preview-nav a:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--paper); }
      .preview-nav .current {
        background: var(--accent); color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500;
      }

      .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

      /* Hero card */
      .hero-section {
        padding-top: 5rem;
        padding-bottom: 3rem;
      }
      .hero-card {
        background: var(--paper);
        border-radius: 2rem;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        box-shadow:
          0 20px 60px rgba(61, 44, 36, 0.08),
          0 1px 3px rgba(61, 44, 36, 0.04);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-card { padding: 4rem; border-radius: 2.5rem; }
      }
      .hero-card::before {
        content: ""; position: absolute;
        top: -50%; right: -10%;
        width: 60%; height: 100%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--bg-1) 0%, transparent 60%);
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.6;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; }
      }

      .hero-eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
        background: var(--bg-1);
        padding: 0.375rem 0.875rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--accent-dark);
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .hero-eyebrow .dot {
        width: 6px; height: 6px;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .hero-name {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
        font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 7vw, 5rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 1.0;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      .hero-name em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .hero-role {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      }

      .hero-tagline {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: var(--ink);
        max-width: 32rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.875rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.25s ease;
      }
      .btn-primary {
        background: var(--accent); color: var(--paper);
      }
      .btn-primary:hover {
        background: var(--accent-dark);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(201, 123, 123, 0.3);
      }
      .btn-ghost {
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--bg-1);
      }
      .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--bg-2); }

      /* Portrait */
      .hero-portrait {
        aspect-ratio: 4/5;
        border-radius: 1.5rem;
        background:
          linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, var(--bg-2) 100%);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(201, 123, 123, 0.2);
      }
      .hero-portrait::after {
        content: "R";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 12rem;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
        line-height: 1;
      }

      /* Social row */
      .social-row {
        display: flex; gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        position: relative;
      }
      .social-pill {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.375rem;
        background: var(--bg-1);
        padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .social-pill:hover {
        background: var(--accent);
        color: var(--paper);
      }

      /* About card */
      .about-card {
        background: var(--paper);
        border-radius: 2rem;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(61, 44, 36, 0.06);
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .about-card { padding: 3.5rem; border-radius: 2.5rem; }
      }
      .section-eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        color: var(--accent);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
      .section-title {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        max-width: 32rem;
      }
      .section-title em {
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--accent);
      }
      .about-text p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        color: var(--ink);
        max-width: 38rem;
      }
      .pullquote {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
        color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--bg-1);
        padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        max-width: 36rem;
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }

      /* Footer */
      footer {
        padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: 'Inter', monospace;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="preview-nav">
      <a href="/en/preview/v1/">V1 Editorial</a>
      <a href="/en/preview/v2/">V2 Bold</a>
      <span class="current">V3 Soft</span>
      <a href="/en/preview/" title="back to index">↩</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="wrap">
      <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-grid">
            <div>
              <span class="hero-eyebrow">
                <span class="dot"></span>Open to AI roles · 2026
              </span>
              <h1 class="hero-name">
                Hi, I'm <em>Rain</em>.
              </h1>
              <p class="hero-role">A finance person becoming a builder.</p>
              <p class="hero-tagline">
                M.A. in Public Finance from SWUFE, CPA, 3 years at KPMG audit — then I started using AI to rebuild finance workflows. This year I'm writing code and shipping products, helping teams still in repetitive work hand the flow over to agents.
              </p>
              <div class="hero-cta">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#">See projects →</a>
                <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#">Get in touch</a>
              </div>

              <div class="social-row">
                <a class="social-pill" href="#">📧 Email</a>
                <a class="social-pill" href="#">⌗ GitHub</a>
                <a class="social-pill" href="#">in LinkedIn</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-portrait"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <article class="about-card">
          <p class="section-eyebrow">01 · About</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">
            The path isn't neat,<br />
            but the thread is <em>consistent</em>.
          </h2>
          <div class="about-text">
            <p>
              My foundation is finance: B.A. in Investment, M.A. in Public Finance from SWUFE, CPA Accounting passed, 3 years at KPMG Shenzhen audit — dual-standard consolidations for 30+ subsidiaries, leading financial due diligence for IPO-bound clients. That gave me two things: the ability to read a company, and a deep aversion to repetitive work.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2024 I left KPMG and joined a short-form video startup as a finance BP. There I first brought AI into multi-platform revenue reconciliation, lifting efficiency by 30%. From that moment I saw clearly:
            </p>
            <blockquote class="pullquote">
              AI doesn't free programmers; it frees people who understand the business but are trapped by the process.
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              In 2026 I used Cursor + Claude Code to deliver a real, paid e-commerce system in 5 weeks.
              What I want now is simple — a role that combines "business understanding" with "getting things done with AI."
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
    </div>

    <footer class="wrap">
      <p>V3 · Soft Portrait — Cream #F8EDE3 · Rose #C97B7B · Cormorant / Inter</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
